hadiths[28]{hadithnumber,text}:
"101","'A'isha reported that the Prophet"
"102","Abu Shurayh al-Khuza'i reported that the Prophet"
"103","Al-Miqdad ibn al-Aswad reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"104","Ibn 'Umar reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"105","Mujahid reported that a sheep was slaughtered for 'Abdullah ibn 'Amr.\nHe asked his slave"
"106","Same as 101."""""
"107","'A'isha said"
"108","same as 108 with a different isnad."""""
"109","Al-Hasan was asked about the neighbour and said"
"110","Abu Hurayra said"
"111","Ibn 'Umar said"
"112","Ibn 'Abbas informed Ibn az-Zubayr"
"113","'Hear and obey"
"114","Abu Dharr reported that the Prophet"
"115","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr ibn al-'As reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"116","Nafi' ibn 'Abdu'l-Harith reported that the Prophet"
"117","Abu Hurayra said"
"118","Abu Musa reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"119","Abu Hurayra said"
"120","'Umara ibn Ghurab reported that an aunt of his told him that she asked\n'A'isha"
"121","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"122","'Amr ibn Mu'adh al-Ashhali reported that his grandmother said"
"123","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"124","Abu Hurayra said"
"125","Abu Juhayfa said"
"126","Jabir said"
"127","Thawban said"
"128","Mujahid said"
